        <mxCell id="u7eyhcFoZ07W-lRjyVvM-70" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;Simple microdungeon with one petport, one Hive Ant pet with a farming module, and a custom farming object that produces the baby larva item. Built to match the dark purple hive aesthetic.&lt;br&gt;&quot;Hive Ants&quot; aren&#39;t actually ants. That&#39;s just what we&#39;re calling these alien creatures until I have a better name for them. Storage container with configured deposit beacon, too.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=20;" vertex="1" parent="1">
